{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "7484961962fa3a21e5feb5e2b68970b8cb3eb80ca227c5461a4fc25c990bcaa4", "ja": "うーん、あると思ったんだけどなぁ……。\n白じゃなくてもいいかなぁ……？", "zh": "嗯——我还以为会有的呢……\n不一定非得是白色的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3ea4b88f0e9b5ecd6b558e7e59a727e7ff090449d67d5ee5b12f054ffb528afd", "ja": "あれ、青羽さん。何か探しものですか？", "zh": "哎，青羽小姐。在找什么东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8383cd2fb968afc2251b350c1f95bbc2d83e771feedda638ff280423969b5a8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nはい！　決闘のために、白い布を……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n是的！为了决斗，正在找一块白布……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b99c5a60bd32889cb7a9228a9f11ff268b218b43ee3db8d435726c1b653c4593", "ja": "決闘！？　……あ、仕事ですか。\nでも、そんなドラマの予定とかありましたっけ？", "zh": "决斗！？……啊，是工作吗？\n不过，最近有安排这样的戏剧工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "c38d54046b4fac9b7b40ac4772cb17ef6ad70008be9a365d1450d57b1f42fe09", "ja": "へっ？　……あ、いえ！　その、いつか\nそういう事もあるかもしれないなって……えへへ。", "zh": "咦？……啊，不是！那个，只是想着，说不定哪天也会发生这种事……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "588212280a740bcfe0bfbc66218d240e6cf48b4edc1c6a40ed2939597ac9f444", "ja": "そうですか。てっきり、\n青羽さんが決闘するのかと思って、焦りました。", "zh": "这样啊。我还以为是青羽小姐要决斗，吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "75eccb40cd3bd5c35d5d17222ca4e55cd333bd9bd143c793983120480643d9ee", "ja": "でも、確か決闘って、法律で禁止されてましたよね。\nだから、そんなわけないかって。", "zh": "不过，我记得决斗是法律禁止的吧。所以我就想，应该不可能是那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "88f816d6d709553be8928e0212284ec90b8fe0ce2a8a2dcc60f1e5d680a35e40", "ja": "ええっ！？　そうなんですか？\nじゃあ手袋もいらないですかね……？", "zh": "诶！？是这样吗？\n那手套也不需要了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "48b27032999e93251221efc941bd5639be05146b3018f50efef9c915346926dc", "ja": "どうでしょう？　作品の時代とか、\n内容によると思いますけど……。", "zh": "您觉得呢？我想这应该取决于作品的时代背景和内容吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "71527aca2d6f010c8c012b5c4fc12a14d0d22046effd5bc322cbacaceb7eb170", "ja": "けど、どうして決闘なんですか？", "zh": "可是，为什么要决斗呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "eb92837015e3e2381d820e08efd7b4bcd46f52c1925017d1934c2f2201c42d70", "ja": "あっ……そうでした！", "zh": "啊……对哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "e3a87e2c90e4996e2745cda7c9dea464d61d26c1e9ad1189aeb6528fdc856040", "ja": "{$P$}さん宛てに、社長さんから\n書き置きを預かったんです。でも、それが……。", "zh": "我收到了社长写给{$P$}先生的留言。不过，那张留言……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8c06f8206c5b363ba632c82989b0ee3e7c3dc103df0579ecfaafb54190323b6c", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\nえーっと……「社長室で待つ」……？", "zh": "啊，谢谢。\n呃……“在社长室等着”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "a67ee47c585281133856f048db95e2e604a094bd492e18cad634d1122ee83487", "ja": "すみません……これを見たら、\nなんだか果たし状っぽいなって思っちゃって……。", "zh": "对不起……看到这个之后，\n不知怎么的，就觉得好像是挑战书……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9d38d11c016f6b64dd83afadab706d2558ae55581c97d1d56fe593f278bdd337", "ja": "果たし状……社長に恨まれるような事したかな……。\nとりあえず、行ってきますね！", "zh": "决斗书……我做过什么会让社长记恨的事吗……总之，我先过去一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "428ddd8235586aaf18bd3fab75f36aaa756c018587e6385c21970d6e4e2d3e3d", "ja": "は～い、行ってらっしゃい！\n手袋は拾っちゃだめですからね～！", "zh": "好——一路小心！  \n可别捡手套哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1016_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "7bce3fc28d517c4ef119ebd86a0b9de5b321ee16f99f70c623b5565c8fdf8a55", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n決闘ですよ、決闘！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n决斗，是决斗啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7a7bdbdbeed105e056db95cce552537f6a2c4b9e0297d9d3b3c62dcab127fa17", "ja": "け、決闘……音無さんまで……。\nあの、何か失礼な事しちゃいましたか……？", "zh": "决、决斗……连音无小姐也……  \n那个，我是不是做了什么失礼的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "4ee5002ec886ca0a396cf3a8b5f05287bf92c2b5044d88f28607e24a40560cf3", "ja": "私じゃありませんよ！　ワールドワイドなアイドルを\n集めた新グループが、日本に殴り込みに来たんです！", "zh": "不是我啦！是一个汇聚了来自世界各地的偶像的新团体，要来日本大干一场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "4a9c80407b974606128b50e5beeb8f44898b7b816a17d9daef13acfcc24ff198", "ja": "その名も……『セクシービーストプロジェクト』！", "zh": "其名为……“性感野兽企划”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "562e4174d7478cf43d5247a531217b60f51322ac323c3ed799474fbb40b6c021", "ja": "セクシービースト……。\nあ、もしかして……！", "zh": "性感野兽……  \n啊，难道是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "34f005c92ca3d9991866488a89b3b587fc6d1f5e3547ec49641b1503b9e1ef1e", "ja": "ああ、そのセクシービーストだよ。\n君は、その時に面識があるんだったね？", "zh": "啊，就是那个性感野兽。\n你当时和她认识，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "75d0dcd22439172b42db2cc98a1fff4515f4c00d5930439c03ed8913a1af9d89", "ja": "はい。このみさんと莉緒のSherry 'n Cherryが\n『クラブミリオン』に出演した時に。", "zh": "是的，是在这个み小姐和莉绪的Sherry 'n Cherry参加《Million Club》演出的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "82332ab57189eb7c561d124a5d454fcbe4da32731e5c5d65fb1c51943dea2361", "ja": "でもセクシービーストは、ソロでしたよね？", "zh": "不过“性感野兽”是单人出演的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "5ef8ab2f26ce9684fc8fda0483858388858b719621233f19620cdae0c4b674a7", "ja": "ソロアイドルだった彼女が、世界中から仲間を集めて\n来たんだよ。……我が765プロと勝負するためにね。", "zh": "曾经是单人偶像的她，召集了来自世界各地的伙伴来到了这里。……就是为了和我们765事务所一决胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0cc3ff0825dd7eb7e27e4f55e35f9fa55d7df834da737e2aaa8cfbf6e9f9e52b", "ja": "765プロと勝負……！？", "zh": "和765艺能胜负……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "4e9aae5607a03c914875e87d21a58a2e737ac04ce83617cefe18cfdfbd44b8c2", "ja": "今朝、事務所に手紙……いえ挑戦状が届いたんです。\n「クラブミリオンでの借りは返す」って。", "zh": "今天早上，事务所收到了一封信……不，是挑战书。\n上面写着：“在百万俱乐部欠下的账，我会讨回来的。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "1eef732dddb30afec86bf66f76d24c9f8b2c81bdac9dec1a03552c9c49ba8bf3", "ja": "どうやらクラブミリオンの一件で、\n765プロのアイドルに思うところがあったようでね。", "zh": "看来，他似乎因为Club Million那件事，对765Pro的偶像有些想法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "e62ff557fea0ad63490a45d7d8a4466f066c5c3e99a9364537d58e5637153feb", "ja": "あれから、世界中を旅しながら、\n修行していたんだそうだ。", "zh": "听说从那以后，一边周游世界，一边修行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7f4470c64085b933edb01fb12489bd1b7f54b4cfc49c1dfdec062698df73c823", "ja": "なるほど……。しかし、勝負といっても……\nセクシーを……？", "zh": "原来如此……不过，既然说是对决……比性感……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "f797e36d3146756084b11a8337353dcacdfebdc41d1c834cabf6911433b095bb", "ja": "いや、今回彼女たちが提示してきたのは、\nアイドルとしての『ダンスバトル』だ。", "zh": "不，这次她们提出的是\n作为偶像的“街舞对决”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "99204fb78948700d345f11a052b02c4bf245eb1300289d5c428b077a7b36e67d", "ja": "ダンスに特化した特別会場を用意して、\nバトルの様子を世界中に生配信するイベントらしい。", "zh": "据说这是准备专门用于舞蹈的特别会场，并向全世界进行战斗直播的活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "4d93f5b395197f12e2e55453571b6015fbda82c0bf69f6ae5232c0ef56e1fd6e", "ja": "調べてみたところ、セクシービーストプロジェクトは\nかなりダンスに長けたメンバーが多いみたいなんです。", "zh": "我调查了一下，发现性感野兽计划里似乎有很多成员都非常擅长跳舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "7c36d13e93256ca1733b568e418588d9e8bd922368d4056cc4b568a950697700", "ja": "アイドルのダンスバトルを、世界中に生配信？\nなんだかすごい事になってきましたね……。", "zh": "偶像的舞蹈对决要向全世界进行直播？事情好像变得不得了了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1035_president", "source_sha256": "ddbbbdefd86736fc1ff91a4bdc837ce2d1dcc951383925e2ce87b56e8e96ca96", "ja": "ああ。しかしこの勝負に勝てば、アイドル諸君にとって\n大きなチャンスになるのは間違いないだろう！", "zh": "啊，不过，要是赢下这场比赛，对各位偶像来说无疑会成为一个很大的机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "a1e7225e270b6e1abec94ae528add45b6f92dc9f8f4a739bc807f8fffa3b8802", "ja": "君には、ぜひこの機会を物にしてもらいたい。\n頼めるかね？", "zh": "我非常希望你能抓住这次机会。\n能拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1037_p", "source_sha256": "b4a4c975d051b76a8dd22e57d0345a99fcc3ef20f6ddebed75888f2ef200509c", "ja": "わかりました。セクシービーストプロジェクト……\n強敵ですが、みんなが劣っているとは思いません。", "zh": "我明白了。性感野兽计划……\n虽然是个强敌，但我并不认为大家会比她们逊色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ab7b7d5eb1f19aed19a5adb90135cd93def81319d13c0da6eddb483455392853", "ja": "全員の力を合わせて、765プロの名前を\n世界中に轟かせてみせます！", "zh": "齐心协力，一定要让765事务所的名号响彻全世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1039_president", "source_sha256": "b694c0515bb1d48c86249489e7e243cf302cd6822ec245a0d5c46b19aea00179", "ja": "うむ、その意気だ！\n期待しているよ！", "zh": "嗯，就该有这股干劲！\n我很看好你哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1040_101kot", "source_sha256": "363ba85ddc34b6f71e10ae260cfd4a3f703d31982a69df24ac71739dad212907", "ja": "765プロ総出の闘いになりますからね！\n気合いを入れていきましょう！", "zh": "这可是要765艺能倾巢出动的战斗呢！\n打起精神来加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1041_p", "source_sha256": "d5daf848074130f2f884ad0d5247a7e4fd24bd756bf4564f6ac6085350ab9f2c", "ja": "（よし、そうと決まればさっそく準備だ！\n相手は海外仕込みのダンスアイドル達……）", "zh": "（好，既然决定了就马上准备吧！\n对手是受过海外训练的舞蹈偶像们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_intro_1042_p", "source_sha256": "caebfb9826dd253ceefefdf7f05cfa5ae5fc2e5c09503b42104b5bfd78a7c9a3", "ja": "（海外、ダンスとくれば……\nまずは歩に、話を聞いてみよう！）", "zh": "说到海外和舞蹈……先去问问步吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
